WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.787
Lists work naturally with built-in summary functions.

00:00:03.787 --> 00:00:08.542
The four monthly sales values add to fifty-three thousand two hundred.

00:00:08.542 --> 00:00:13.117
Dividing by four gives an average of thirteen thousand three hundred.

00:00:13.117 --> 00:00:17.609
Max identifies fourteen thousand nine hundred as the best month.

00:00:18.154 --> 00:00:25.001
The pattern is simple but important: collect values, calculate a summary, then interpret it.

00:00:25.001 --> 00:00:31.306
Later, Pandas will give us more advanced summary tools, but the underlying logic is the same.
